<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><fdroid><repo icon="icon.png" name="Alisher's apps" pubkey="" timestamp="1785489474" url="https://xalisher.github.io/fdroid/repo" version="20002"><description>Private, self-hosted Android apps on Logos — no Google, no accounts, no central server. Peers: a peer-to-peer messenger over Logos, MeshCore (LoRa) and Bluetooth mesh, end-to-end and at-rest encrypted. Booth &amp; Receiver: broadcast and tune in to decentralised anonymous radio over Tor + Logos Messaging.</description></repo><application id="com.boothandroid"><id>com.boothandroid</id><added>2026-07-06</added><lastupdated>2026-07-06</lastupdated><name>Booth</name><summary>Broadcast a decentralised anonymous radio station</summary><desc>Broadcast a decentralised, anonymous radio station from your phone: create a
station, speak into the mic, and listeners tune in over Tor + Logos Messaging.

Three-phase flow (Setup → Staging → Live) with a live-status dashboard, a
real-time mic waveform, mute, and identity tiers: Anon, on-device key, or a
hardware Keycard over NFC. The broadcasting mirror of Receiver.</desc><license>MIT</license><categories>Internet,Multimedia</categories><category>Internet</category><web></web><source>https://github.com/xAlisher/booth-android</source><tracker>https://github.com/xAlisher/booth-android/issues</tracker><author>xAlisher</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>1</marketvercode><package><version>0.1.0</version><versioncode>1</versioncode><apkname>booth-android-0.1.0-arm64.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">4d8079dc3ddc2f380d3153453472dfc4b04cdef4c20ff2ee083676c666a49492</hash><size>49766209</size><sdkver>24</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>36</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-07-06</added><sig>b6e0344e9cbcbcd6f20dc82b513925f6</sig><permissions>ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_MICROPHONE,INTERNET,NFC,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,RECORD_AUDIO,com.boothandroid.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><nativecode>arm64-v8a</nativecode></package></application><application id="com.logoschat"><id>com.logoschat</id><added>2026-07-28</added><lastupdated>2026-07-31</lastupdated><name>Peers</name><summary>Private peer-to-peer messenger over Logos, MeshCore &amp; Bluetooth</summary><desc>A private, peer-to-peer messenger. Your identity lives on this device — no phone
number, no account, no central server, no Google.

Reach people over three transports: Logos (a pure-Rust delivery node), MeshCore
(LoRa radio), or Bluetooth mesh — one shared timeline, colour-coded by transport.
1:1 and group chats are end-to-end encrypted with MLS; send voice notes, images,
camera photos, and location. Works offline over Bluetooth/LoRa when the network
is down.

Your messages, encryption keys, and identity are encrypted at rest (Android
Keystore + SQLCipher). Optional PIN lock with an auto-lock and duress-wipe.</desc><license>MIT</license><categories>Internet</categories><category>Internet</category><web>https://peers.tech</web><source>https://github.com/xAlisher/peers</source><tracker>https://github.com/xAlisher/peers/issues</tracker><author>xAlisher</author><marketversion></marketversion><marketvercode>97</marketvercode><package><version>0.7.85</version><versioncode>97</versioncode><apkname>peers-0.7.85-arm64.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">fd9f911b529b2f986a287692dec0e93611ff3d4118eb3acd6afc7b6bae1d8a64</hash><size>39859990</size><sdkver>24</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>34</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-07-31</added><sig>b6e0344e9cbcbcd6f20dc82b513925f6</sig><permissions>ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION,ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION,ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,BLUETOOTH,BLUETOOTH_ADMIN,BLUETOOTH_ADVERTISE,BLUETOOTH_CONNECT,BLUETOOTH_SCAN,CAMERA,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC,INTERNET,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,RECORD_AUDIO,VIBRATE,com.logoschat.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><uses-permission maxSdkVersion="30" name="android.permission.BLUETOOTH"/><uses-permission maxSdkVersion="30" name="android.permission.BLUETOOTH_ADMIN"/><nativecode>arm64-v8a</nativecode></package><package><version>0.7.84</version><versioncode>96</versioncode><apkname>peers-0.7.84-arm64.apk</apkname><hash type="sha256">bbc781c9ec798587bd9348fcbe908d6529a75fe8a22c5510d724b29edd6667fd</hash><size>69933156</size><sdkver>24</sdkver><targetSdkVersion>34</targetSdkVersion><added>2026-07-30</added><sig>b6e0344e9cbcbcd6f20dc82b513925f6</sig><permissions>ACCESS_COARSE_LOCATION,ACCESS_FINE_LOCATION,ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE,BLUETOOTH,BLUETOOTH_ADMIN,BLUETOOTH_ADVERTISE,BLUETOOTH_CONNECT,BLUETOOTH_SCAN,CAMERA,FOREGROUND_SERVICE,FOREGROUND_SERVICE_DATA_SYNC,INTERNET,POST_NOTIFICATIONS,RECORD_AUDIO,VIBRATE,com.logoschat.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION</permissions><uses-permission maxSdkVersion="30" name="android.permission.BLUETOOT